ctions/copernicus-digital-elevation-model"},{"name":"ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200","use":"trees, meadow, rock, snow","licence":"CC BY 4.0, © ESA WorldCover project 2021","url":"https://esa-worldcover.org"},{"name":"Tiny Atlas procedural maquette (backend/tools/blender/stupa.py)","use":"the stupa model (18 m high from Livius; about 21 m across, bands and grass cap estimated from the photos)","licence":"Tiny Atlas own procedural geometry","url":"https://github.com/zeshanabdullah10/tinyatlas"},{"name":"Shingardar, Livius (articles/place/shingardar)","use":"published height: the actual monument measures eighteen meters","licence":"Livius.org article, facts cited only","url":"https://www.livius.org/articles/place/shingardar/"},{"name":"OpenStreetMap","use":"the N-95 trunk road (Mingora Road) toward Barikot, and the village lanes and buildings around the stupa","licence":"ODbL, © OpenStreetMap contributors","url":"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright"}]}